                  "fill": "#3A3F4D",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Soft bubbles with a 22 px radius and a tail pointing at the orb. Your words sit right-aligned at the top, with Swift's reply below. Edges are rounded tabs tinted Swift blue, each led by a small state orb.",
