                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "AoljD",
                                  "name": "A cup has about 30 mg of caf",
                                  "fill": "$b-text",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "A cup has about 30 mg of caffeine, a third of a coffee. Caffeine's half-life is five to six hours, so a 4 pm cup still leaves about half of it at 10 pm.",
