                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "WxZK4",
                                  "name": "L-theanine, the amino acid t",
                                  "fill": "$b-text",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "L-theanine, the amino acid that makes green tea taste savoury, softens the jolt. In two small studies it improved sleep quality, but at doses well above one cup.",
