              "fill": "#262B3A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Branch claude/stt-corrections at 83376f1, run in the overlay's dev harness (vite, headless Chrome), frames injected through the dev shim: a spoken request with a kept clip, its answer, a typed request, a Needs your OK request, four answers in a row for the hint count. The fix pane is dev/pane.html sent the fix view. Captures live in boards/stt-corrections-1/. Not covered: the real Tauri pane window, the backend writing the correction, the report script.",
