                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "An inventory of the overlay code (main.ts, pane.ts, panes.ts) against Halo found six surfaces that are built but were never designed: the opened stack, the text box, the tray menu, Swift's own notices, the problem cards, and two small states (the follow-up window and \"say it again\"). Each is redrawn here from Halo's parts. All are PROPOSAL restyles of built behaviour: what they do stays as built.",
