          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1600,
          "content": "Built today as one-off cards (renderNotice, renderProblem). In Halo they're cards about Swift itself, not runs: solid, one neutral State · Notice line (new component) with a mark and a word, and no origin unless your words were involved. A stopped engine is a failure, so it is the only one in red. Sticky problems have no close: they leave when the problem does.",
